menu "PWS proof of concept"

    config POC_I2C_SDA_GPIO
        int "I2C SDA GPIO"
        range 0 48
        default 8
        help
            GPIO connected to the SDA line of the sensor modules.

    config POC_I2C_SCL_GPIO
        int "I2C SCL GPIO"
        range 0 48
        default 9
        help
            GPIO connected to the SCL line of the sensor modules.

endmenu
